+	// CPU readable skinned geometry (ReC, rt stage 3B).
+	//
+	// These two are deliberately declared at the VERY END of the interface, after the destructor and
+	// after the EDITOR_PCDEBUGCODE block, so that every slot an already compiled module resolved
+	// against the previous header keeps its index: the vtable only grows at the back. CryAnimation is
+	// the only module that implements IAttachmentSkin (CAttachmentSKIN and CAttachmentVCLOTH); every
+	// other module is a caller, and a caller that never calls the new methods is unaffected.
